    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fleet composition by risk level",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "elevator_fleet_count",
          "legendFormat": "{{risk_level}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 25,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading this board",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Out of model scope** units are never scored \u2014 they are counted separately rather than bucketed as low risk, because an unmonitored unit is not a healthy one.\n\n**Since last inference** and **No telemetry in 24h** report nothing at all until the telemetry-ingestion change lands. An empty panel here means *not yet known*, which is not the same as zero."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Collector health",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Spans dropped on export",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans_total) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "dropped",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Spans accepted (last 5m)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "accepted",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Export rate by exporter (sent vs dropped)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (exporter) (rate(otelcol_exporter_sent_spans_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "sent \u00b7 {{exporter}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (exporter) (rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "DROPPED \u00b7 {{exporter}}",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cps",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Why this row exists",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "A failing exporter leaves every other panel on this dashboard looking perfectly healthy \u2014 the local pipeline keeps delivering while nothing reaches the remote one. That happened during this milestone: Grafana Cloud returned 401 for every batch and no dashboard showed it.\n\n**Spans accepted** guards the opposite trap: an OpenTelemetry counter has no series until it first increments, so *dropped = 0* and *nothing is being collected at all* look identical. `or vector(0)` forces the drop counter to render a zero rather than \"No data\"."
      }
    }
  ]
}
